NODE id=github.com/paxlabs-inc/deus/internal/hosting.packageArtifact kind=func
  digest=b3:339ac830047a477dd09bb0bab1581e0c7699ce5ca446d6274a25630e785dc4ce file=deus/internal/hosting/appwrite.go range=233:249 lang=go exported=false byte_range=6992:7697
  sig=func packageArtifact(raw []byte) (data []byte, fileName string)
  doc=packageArtifact normalizes the uploaded bundle into a code.tar.gz the Appwrite\ndeployments API can extract.\n\nThe expected artifact is already a gzipped tar of the project, so when we\ndetect the gzip magic bytes (0x1f 0x8b) we pass the bytes through unchanged.\nAs a robustness fallback (e.g. a developer uploaded a plain, uncompressed\ntar) we gzip-wrap the raw bytes so Appwrite still receives a gzip stream.
EDGES
  ^defines=github.com/paxlabs-inc/deus/internal/hosting/appwrite.go

